d.\n\nReason:\nBreaking the King bomb to play the **Straight (10-J-Q-K-A)** is the best strategic choice. It forces the opponents to pass (or waste a bomb) while simultaneously clearing my weak 10 and J. This move leaves a well-structured hand: a Triplet of Kings (KKK) which can carry the weak 6 as a kicker, leaving an endgame of mostly high singles (A, 2, Red Joker) with only the 8 and Q as potential losers. This path minimizes the number of turns required to go out and maximizes the value of my high cards.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣10", "♣J", "♦Q", "♣K", "♦A"]}'}
